om/users/ReloKai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloKai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloKai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloKai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloKai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloKai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloKai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloKai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloKai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T22:46:28Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T22:46:28Z","body":"That's my current workaround yeah.  I just wanted to bring to the team's attention that physics \"seemingly\" wasn't working as intended in this situation.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2892451756/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3602987338","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106368#issuecomment-3602987338","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106368","id":3602987338,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WwTlK","user":{"login":"Rudolph-B","id":52322745,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzIyNzQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52322745?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B","html_url":"https://github.com/Rudolph-B","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T16:43:04Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T16:43:51Z","body":"I'm pretty sure there is a bug here. The problem being when the process callback is set to physics it updates in the physics process step, but when `ignore_time_scale == true` it adjusts the remaining time with the normal process step time not the physics step time.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5f12ada7a4ae9c440e2b22be168c78dba0244075/scene/main/timer.cpp#L70-L79\n\nThis behavior also affect SceneTreeTimer and Tweens since all of the logic is shared originally from SceneTreeTimer","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3602987338/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3603007953","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106368#issuecomment-3603007953","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106368","id":3603007953,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WwYnR","user":{"login":"Rudolph-B","id":52322745,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzIyNzQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52322745?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B","html_url":"https://github.com/Rudolph-B","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"http